# Prompt playground

Use the playground to isolate a prompt change from a production deployment. Start with a representative input, keep the model and tools fixed when diagnosing prompt behavior, and compare the result against the original prompt version.

For a stronger decision, run the candidate across a [dataset](/docs/datasets) and inspect quality, cost, latency, and failure signals. Promote through the environment labels described in [Prompt deployment](/docs/prompts).
